As stated above, F = K\otimes T(F'), and one can see the maps between each pair
of summands. We label the summand K_i**F_{j_1}**..**F_{j_m} with the symbol
(i,\{j_1,..,j_m\}), and we can write out the differentials in block form with
the function picture, with the option Display => "DisplayBlocks", including the
