|             2          2   2     2   4                   |
|o2 = ideal (a , a*b, a*c , b , b*c , c )                  |
|                                                          |
|o2 : Ideal of S                                           |
+----------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : F = freeResolution(S^1/I)                            |
